| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` | Modify | `computed.composerCollapsed` | New computed `$ui.isMobile && inputCollapsed` — single source of truth for hiding the previews while collapsed. |
| `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` | Modify | `composerCollapsed` | `ChatAttachmentPreview` (image preview) now `v-if="attachments?.length && !composerCollapsed"` so it disappears when reading. |
| `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` | Modify | `composerCollapsed` | `#files` `ChatFileList` (files preview) now `v-if="files?.length && !composerCollapsed"`. |
| `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` | Modify | `#input` slot → `ChatInputBox` | Passes `:attachment-count` / `:file-count` so the collapsed pill shows a pending-items badge. |

## 4. Verification

**Behaviour matrix (mobile, `$ui.isMobile` = width ≤ 1024px)**

| State | Action | Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Collapsed | Tap the pill | Pill `.stop` → `toggle-collapsed` → expands + focuses editor + keyboard |
| Collapsed | Tap the message list | Already collapsed, handler no-ops (no flicker) |
| Collapsed | Tap inside composer (intellisense/previews if visible) | `inside === collapsed` → expands |
| Expanded | Tap textarea / toolbar / dropdown / thumbnail | `isInsideComposer` → no collapse, interaction works |
| Expanded | Tap a message (reading) | Collapses **and** hides image + files previews |
| Expanded | Attach image then tap outside | Collapses; pill shows the `📎 n` badge; snippet preserved via `collapsedDraft` |
| Editing (`editMessage`) | Any tap | `isEditing` guard + `watch: editMessage` keep the composer expanded |
| Desktop | Any tap | `isMobile` false → `onDocumentClick` returns; `composerCollapsed` false → previews always visible |

**Regression checks**
- `QuickChatView` home input: no `collapsed`/count props → no pill, no badge, unchanged.
- Draft safety: when collapsing with text + attachments, `collapsedDraft` keeps the text and `getEditorText()` still returns it (the 100 ms `onMessageChange` poll cannot wipe `editorText`).
- The collapsed pill is still the sole interactive element while collapsed, so the `.stop` toggle can never be duplicated by the document listener.

**Optional follow-up** (tell me if you want it): while collapsed, replace the generic "Write a message..." with the first line of the draft (like Slack/WhatsApp), which pairs nicely with the new pending-items badge.

